        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SCD100, Solid Brass Decorative Screw Cover</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass, this 1\" outside diameter decorative screw cover can be used with wood screws, sheet metal screws or machine screws up to 1/4\" diameter. For use with flat head or tapered screws. Available in 9 decorative finishes. This screw cover are comprised of two pieces: the bottom screw base plate and the top cover plate. To install, put the screw thru the bottom base plate hole and tighten the screw. Then, the top cover plate screws onto the bottom base plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SC100-specifications.gif?v=1704354661\" width=\"597\" height=\"151\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana SCD100 Solid Brass Decorative Screw Cover Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/sleek-screw-cover-deltana-scf100\"><b>Deltana SCF100 Flat Top Screw Cover</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for the Deltana SCD100 Decorative Screw Cover:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Outside Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Hole Diameter: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCD100.pdf?v=1691095385\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SCD100 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
