                "description": "Solid Brass Decorative Screw Cover Deltana SCD100 - Made of solid brass, this 1 inch outside diameter decorative screw cover can be used with wood screws, sheet metal screws or machine screws up to 1/4 inch diameter. For use with flat head or tapered screws. Available in 9 decorative finishes. This screw cover are comprised of two pieces: the bottom screw base plate and the top cover plate. To install, put the screw thru the bottom base plate hole and tighten the screw. Then, the top cover plate screws onto the bottom base plate.",
